%p A new AntCat API key was issued.

%table
  %tr
    %th{align: 'left'} Name
    %td=@api_key.name
  %tr
    %th{align: 'left'} Email
    %td=@api_key.email
  %tr
    %th{align: 'left'} Institution
    %td=@api_key.institution.presence || '(none)'
  %tr
    %th{align: 'left'} Project
    %td=simple_format @api_key.project
  %tr
    %th{align: 'left'} Level
    %td=@api_key.level
  %tr
    %th{align: 'left'} Key starts with
    %td=@api_key.key_prefix
  %tr
    %th{align: 'left'} Issued
    %td=@api_key.confirmed_at&.utc&.to_fs(:db)

%p
  Revoke it, change the level or set limits:
  =link_to 'API keys admin page', @admin_url
